{'symbol': 'AMP', 'date': '2023-06-12 11:46:00', 'title': 'ADVISOR BRINGS HIS $250 MILLION PRACTICE TO AMERIPRISE, JOINING FORCES WITH FELLOW ADVISOR', 'text': 'MINNEAPOLIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FINANCIAL ADVISOR MICHAEL SCHWARTZ, CFP® AND TEAM RECENTLY BROUGHT THEIR PRACTICE TO THE INDEPENDENT CHANNEL OF AMERIPRISE FINANCIAL, INC. (NYSE: AMP) FROM CETERA ADVISOR NETWORKS, LLC WITH NEARLY $250 MILLION IN CLIENT ASSETS. SCHWARTZ AND TEAM JOINED AN ESTABLISHED AMERIPRISE PRACTICE IN NEW YORK CITY, IRON BIRCH ADVISORS, WHICH IS LED BY AMERIPRISE PRIVATE WEALTH ADVISOR GREGORY MANTO, CRPC™, APMA™. IRON BIRCH ADVISORS WAS ESTABLISHED IN 2018 AND MANAGES OVER $7.'}